    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="prose">
    <h1>Pregnancy Weight Gain: What Is Healthy?</h1>

    <p>Weight gain is a normal and necessary part of pregnancy. The baby, placenta, amniotic fluid, increased blood volume, breast tissue, and maternal fat stores all contribute. But how much weight should you gain?</p>

